Peer dependency
  The package declares a peer dependency on @deepseek-ai/schemastery, which the
  DeepSeek Harness installation supplies. It is used only for the Config schema;
  every runtime capability — the web server, the authenticated Fetch seam, the
  connection/cookie checks, the subprocess provider, the logger — is reached
  through the Cordis context object.

